VITE_STRAPI_URL=https://your-strapi-host.example.com

# Grants read API (workers/grant-automation). Locally it runs on port 4100;
# in production it is served by nginx at <host>/grants/api.
VITE_GRANTS_API_URL=http://localhost:4100

# WARNING: every VITE_ variable is compiled into the public JS bundle and is
# visible to anyone who opens the site, so never put a token or secret here.
# Public content is readable because the Strapi Public role has find/findOne
# on public collections (granted at boot in backend/research-cms/src/index.ts).

# If your Cohorts collection plural API ID differs from `cohorts`:
# VITE_STRAPI_COHORTS_PLURAL=cohorts
